[19.064755, "o", "╭────────────────────────── ✔ Verified Surgical Patch (py_compile: PASS | pytest: 3/3 PASS) ───────────────────────────╮\r\n│    1 --- a/src/coordinator.py                                                                                        │\r\n│    2 +++ b/src/coordinator.py                                                                                        │\r\n│    3 @@ -44,7 +44,12 @@                                                                                              │\r\n│    4      class ConsensusCoordinator:                                                                                │\r\n│    5 -        def propose_state(self, new_state):                                                                    │\r\n│    6 -            self._lock.acquire()                                                                               │\r\n│    7 -            self._state = new_state                                                                            │\r\n│    8 +        def propose_state(self, new_state: NodeState) -> ConsensusState:                                       │\r\n│    9 +            \"\"\"Atomic state transition with lock-free CAS and heartbeat guard.\"\"\"                              │\r\n│   10 +            if not self._heartbeat.is_alive():                                                                 │\r\n│   11 +                raise HeartbeatTimeoutError(\"Leader lease expired\")                                            │\r\n│   12 +            if self._cas.compare_and_swap(self._state, new_state):                                             │\r\n│   13 +                return ConsensusState(accepted=True, epoch=self._epoch)                                        │\r\n│   14 +            return ConsensusState(accepted=False, reason=\"CAS conflict\")                                       │\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
[19.734017, "o", "╭───────────────────────────────────────────── 🔊 AI VOICEOVER NARRATION ──────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\n│  🎙️ [1:10 - 2:10] AI Narrator: \"This is what sets K-CLI apart from every other AI code tool. It does not just        │\r\n│  generate code and hope for the best. It catches its own compiler error on the first attempt, self-heals the type    │\r\n│  annotation, recompiles to a confirmed green pass, and ONLY THEN stages the patch. Closed-loop, compiler-verified    │\r\n│  engineering.\"                                                                                                       │\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
